{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_049_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:2e612c528ec6e0f7ee0e37a7381d7104c542d0a6b0a9f7d1feb2eb594fd66ba4",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_049_22:5_01_049_22_a:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:80b5bbc857be182ba6e33c365ee0fa90fefa4e497a8a36a2851f8e0f89046bb2",
      "text": "啊啊，情人节巧克力吗。\n谢谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_049_22:5_01_049_22_a:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:270402e5e653e6ce63765fe7ae32838b917bdafcf6b1a0baf478cdee1acd116e",
      "text": "……嗯，怎么了。\n“对收到巧克力表现得很习以为常”？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_049_22:5_01_049_22_a:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5dc7d7055dac2f3a93b60a31b9f556042fc0787a7d83048fd67bd4b544e2458f",
      "text": "这个时期，毕竟会从大量相关人士那里收到甜点啊……\n回过神来就已经习惯了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_049_22:5_01_049_22_a:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5fb44b96af13cb9785593eb81659316ea094b9fd340491641964394dffba892a",
      "text": "对了，回礼想要什么。有什么要求吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_049_22:5_01_049_22_a:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f5a3cab7b981944b24a51cab415d5c68aa5114e37b8baac8579f3cc8aa43889",
      "text": "我正在为了白色情人节整理回礼清单。\n要是有想要的东西，我就提前准备好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_049_22:5_01_049_22_b:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:91965afea2ce006a7db3c70dabe72aff13580adc8b14cab328c94761c7b48b27",
      "text": "谢谢。\n这盒巧克力我会珍惜着品尝的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_049_22:5_01_049_22_b:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3cbca8b49508e23b6c9da7edda4f6b6e84b98b1061b7f05d528db9ed4d014a50",
      "text": "特意说出来或许有些不解风情……\n不过你也是挤出工作间隙特意为我准备的吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_049_22:5_01_049_22_b:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71e5fb263af1e4d50851c61db4be46f2112635cd4932aab6f74e8b0dbf1636b1",
      "text": "虽说与你相识尚短，但这种事我还是看得出来的。\n所以，谢谢你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_049_22:5_01_049_22_b:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dfbe1b455fc050f7bc97ad08282ba15a57b15b08d4bfc113487146a924a2b62b",
      "text": "既然收下了，我便有回应的义务。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_049_22:5_01_049_22_b:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a205ded037ccab3b60db1a2a7a06180b4313092f1d621ce900b64cf8be5fe005",
      "text": "白色情人节，我必定奉还与你付出的\n时间与心意相称的回礼。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_049_22:5_01_049_22_b:cmd-000034:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:afe7cf5d2e90d58cefda05f7b99c5009478aca793aa534c4dab2b86ece509a1f",
      "text": "光是这份心意就足够了",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_049_22:5_01_049_22_b:cmd-000035:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b97842fa8ccf5c3b155bb1dfce40f44f2d320cbb5a8cf8252f98275a3ee16d0f",
      "text": "我很期待哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_049_22:5_01_049_22_b:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b746fca6581988a3a521cbec45e0d23380188b99cc28d9dbe0da38e2ca955c86",
      "text": "既然如此，我就将这份心意化作具体的形态送给你吧。\n好好期待着吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_049_22:5_01_049_22_b:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d9d6bc95c6ae835d5f353478e75cc23c90de2f9db2d77f7f3ce965f364fbd91",
      "text": "这样啊。听了你的回答，\n我也开始期待起白色情人节了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_049_22:5_01_049_22_b:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5f7fc79b2c2dc870f02cd06dc3419c9f3dccc57aaafafbdf21a8e42b606c006",
      "text": "今年的白色情人节，似乎会与往年有所不同呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
